Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 14:59:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] data: credit NS Health doctor recruitment film + start social
 edits backlog

Add Dr. Babatolu's Journey (Journeyman / Nova Scotia Health) to resume.json:
fine edit, colour, and sound on the 8-minute film, plus the three social
trailers. New src/data/social-edits.json holds social cuts awaiting links;
not rendered yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
