+        "Fine edit, colour, and sound on Journeyman's Nova Scotia Health doctor recruitment film (Dr. Babatolu's Journey), plus its social media trailers.",
         "Full-service delivery: scripting, directing, editing, colour, motion graphics, and multi-platform versioning."
