       "description": "Ongoing series with portfolio manager Randy Stuart: screen-recorded investment workflow, direct-to-camera commentary, and editorial narrative. Titles: Bandwidth (2024), the importance of taxes for investment income (2025), investment risk (2025). Produced for client retention and business development.",
